WEBVTT

00:00:14.798 --> 00:00:16.626
WOMAN:
I admit some confusion

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:19.151
upon receiving your letter,
Mr. Dumbledore.

00:00:19.194 --> 00:00:20.891
In all the years
Tom's been here,

00:00:20.935 --> 00:00:22.980
he's never once had
a family visitor.

00:00:23.024 --> 00:00:25.200
There have been incidents
with the other children.

00:00:25.244 --> 00:00:26.984
Nasty things.

00:00:29.161 --> 00:00:31.467
Tom, you have a visitor.

00:00:31.511 --> 00:00:33.600
How do you do, Tom?

00:00:41.086 --> 00:00:42.826
Don't.

00:00:50.138 --> 00:00:51.748
You're the doctor,
aren't you?

00:00:51.792 --> 00:00:53.359
No.

00:00:53.402 --> 00:00:56.144
I am a professor.

00:00:56.188 --> 00:00:58.146
I don't believe you.

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:00.279
She wants me looked at.

00:01:00.322 --> 00:01:03.108
They think I'm different.

00:01:03.151 --> 00:01:04.761
Well, perhaps they're right.

00:01:04.805 --> 00:01:06.372
I'm not mad.

00:01:06.415 --> 00:01:09.940
Hogwarts is not a place
for mad people.

00:01:09.984 --> 00:01:12.639
Hogwarts is a school.

00:01:12.682 --> 00:01:13.988
A school of magic.

00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:22.170
You can do things,
can't you, Tom?

00:01:22.214 --> 00:01:25.042
Things other children can't.

00:01:26.261 --> 00:01:30.135
I can make things move
without touching them.

00:01:30.178 --> 00:01:34.226
I can make animals do what
I want without training them.

00:01:34.269 --> 00:01:38.665
I can make bad things happen
to people who are mean to me.

00:01:38.708 --> 00:01:41.102
I can make them hurt

00:01:41.146 --> 00:01:43.322
if I want.

00:01:43.365 --> 00:01:45.367
Who are you?

00:01:45.411 --> 00:01:47.456
Well, I'm like you, Tom.

00:01:48.849 --> 00:01:50.416
I'm different.

00:01:51.286 --> 00:01:52.853
Prove it.

00:02:00.295 --> 00:02:02.210
I think there's something
in your wardrobe

00:02:02.254 --> 00:02:04.256
trying to get out, Tom.

00:02:04.299 --> 00:02:06.301
[♪♪♪]

00:02:13.874 --> 00:02:17.791
Thievery is not tolerated
at Hogwarts, Tom.

00:02:17.834 --> 00:02:20.924
At Hogwarts, you'll be taught
not only how to use magic,

00:02:20.968 --> 00:02:23.666
but how to control it.

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:25.015
You understand me?

00:02:28.802 --> 00:02:30.847
I can speak to snakes too.

00:02:32.675 --> 00:02:35.330
They find me.

00:02:35.374 --> 00:02:37.419
Whisper things.

00:02:37.463 --> 00:02:40.727
Is that normal
for someone like me?

00:03:01.748 --> 00:03:05.055
Did you know, sir? Then?

00:03:05.099 --> 00:03:07.101
Did I know I'd just met
the most dangerous

00:03:07.144 --> 00:03:11.366
dark wizard of all time? No.

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:13.977
If I had, I...

00:03:15.196 --> 00:03:17.764
Over time,
while here at Hogwarts,

00:03:17.807 --> 00:03:21.289
Tom Riddle grew close
to one particular teacher.

00:03:21.333 --> 00:03:23.248
Can you guess
who that teacher might be?

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:27.948
You didn't bring
Professor Slughorn back

00:03:27.991 --> 00:03:29.645
simply to teach Potions,
did you, sir?

00:03:29.689 --> 00:03:31.865
No, I did not.

00:03:31.908 --> 00:03:34.128
You see, Professor Slughorn
possesses something

00:03:34.171 --> 00:03:36.739
I desire very dearly.

00:03:36.783 --> 00:03:38.741
And he will not give it up
easily.

00:03:38.785 --> 00:03:42.136
You said Professor Slughorn
would try to collect me.

00:03:42.179 --> 00:03:44.094
I did.

00:03:44.138 --> 00:03:46.401
Do you want me to let him?

00:03:47.576 --> 00:03:48.882
Yes.

00:04:05.115 --> 00:04:07.117
[CHIRPING]

00:04:24.657 --> 00:04:26.659
[RECORD SKIPPING]

00:04:35.189 --> 00:04:37.191
[♪♪♪]

00:05:09.223 --> 00:05:11.225
[CHATTERING]

00:05:13.053 --> 00:05:14.837
HARRY:
All right. Um.

00:05:14.881 --> 00:05:17.231
Okay, so this morning,
I'm gonna be putting you all

00:05:17.274 --> 00:05:20.756
through a few drills
just to assess your strengths.

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:23.150
Quiet. Please.

00:05:23.193 --> 00:05:24.499
Shut it!

00:05:24.543 --> 00:05:26.022
[CHATTERING STOPS]

00:05:28.198 --> 00:05:30.418
Thanks. All right. Um.

00:05:30.462 --> 00:05:33.160
Now then, remember, just because
you made the team last year

00:05:33.203 --> 00:05:36.511
does not guarantee you
a spot this year. Is that clear?

00:05:38.687 --> 00:05:40.167
Good.

00:05:41.951 --> 00:05:44.389
[FLY BUZZING]

00:05:49.045 --> 00:05:51.570
No hard feelings, Weasley,
all right?

00:05:51.613 --> 00:05:53.006
Hard feelings?

00:05:53.049 --> 00:05:54.790
Yeah, I'll be going out
for Keeper as well.

00:05:54.834 --> 00:05:56.705
It's nothing personal.

00:05:56.749 --> 00:05:59.447
Really? Strapping guy
like you?

00:05:59.491 --> 00:06:02.276
You've got more of a Beater's
build, don't you think?

00:06:02.319 --> 00:06:04.409
Keepers need to be quick, agile.

00:06:04.452 --> 00:06:06.062
[BUZZING STOPS]

00:06:06.106 --> 00:06:08.021
Oh, I like my chances.

00:06:08.064 --> 00:06:11.981
Say, think you could introduce
me to your friend Granger?

00:06:12.025 --> 00:06:14.462
Wouldn't mind, uh,
getting on a first-name basis,

00:06:14.506 --> 00:06:16.899
know what I mean?

00:06:16.943 --> 00:06:18.553
[♪♪♪]

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:30.347
MAN 1:
Come on, Weasley!

00:06:30.391 --> 00:06:32.262
WOMAN: Come on, Ron!MAN 2: Go on, Weasley!

00:06:33.612 --> 00:06:36.615
MAN 3: Go on, Weasley!MAN 4: Yeah, Ron!

00:06:36.658 --> 00:06:38.051
MAN 5:
Go on, Cormac!

00:06:43.622 --> 00:06:45.798
[GRUNTING]

00:06:54.459 --> 00:06:56.635
WOMAN:
Come on, Ron!

00:07:04.817 --> 00:07:07.167
MAN 6:
Come on, Ron.

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:09.212
Come on, Ron.

